Rym: I just, I literally opened the game, remapped my keys to my weirdo setup that you know and know about and we've talked about.

145
00:12:02,814 --> 00:12:04,622
Rym: I inverted my mouse and I just clicked play.

146
00:12:06,528 --> 00:12:09,578
Rym: I don't know what the menus do, which I'll have to click on at some point.

147
00:12:09,939 --> 00:12:21,233
Scott: Though, full disclosure, to this day, despite playing Fortnite a lot, there's, it seems like based on the first search result I got that the Xbox and PlayStation could play against each other, but not the...

148
00:12:21,473 --> 00:12:32,621
Rym: Okay, that is smart because as Overwatch found, authoritatively, you cannot ever let people with mice play against people with controllers.

149
00:12:32,902 --> 00:12:37,615
