155
00:12:57,644 --> 00:13:03,303
Rym: I've played cross-play Overwatch, which you can do in certain situations and the controller people get auto-aim.

156
00:13:03,323 --> 00:13:10,450
Rym: The auto-aim on a controller ain't got shit on a mouse unless you make that auto-aim just like a complete bot.

157
00:13:13,671 --> 00:13:14,252
Rym: So yeah, we'll see.

158
00:13:14,493 --> 00:13:20,690
Rym: It's uh, it was moderately fun, but it doesn't feel even remotely balanced.

159
00:13:21,490 --> 00:13:27,718
Scott: The only thing I'm going to say is I'm still waiting for the superhero game where the characters have their canon power level.

160
00:13:27,798 --> 00:13:28,741
Rym: I call Galactus.

161
00:13:29,784 --> 00:13:30,627
Scott: Exactly, that's like.

162
00:13:30,687 --> 00:13:33,981
Scott: why, that, people think that game wouldn't be fun and they're wrong.

163
00:13:34,001 --> 00:13:37,276
Rym: Oh, we came up with that the other night, we came up with the way that works.

164
00:13:37,537 --> 00:13:46,574
Rym: If you pick Galactus, your team just plays down a player the whole round and if the other team doesn't beat you by a certain point, then the game is like, all right Galactus,

