00:13:55,534 --> 00:14:02,252
Rym: Professor X is just click mouse one to win unless someone has Juggernaut on their team.

167
00:14:03,194 --> 00:14:12,078
Scott: I'm just saying it's like it should, you know, it'd be fun if there was a mech warrior where you pick a tonnage.

168
00:14:12,942 --> 00:14:14,990
Rym: If you pick Galactus, it's only Galactus, I guess.

169
00:14:15,490 --> 00:14:37,333
Rym: He'd still win, but yeah, so the other funny thing is while we were playing Overwatch with our friend, other Scott Overwatch, I was playing Marvel Overwatch, Marvel Arrivals with our other Scott friend the other night and he was trying to convince me that my idea of why don't we just run a bunch of tanks, because the game has no limits, you could play all tanks if you want, like why do the goat?

170
00:14:37,715 --> 00:14:38,840
Rym: Three tanks, three supports.

171
00:14:39,241 --> 00:14:43,900
Rym: and he tried to convince me that that clearly doesn't work and like you'll just get jumped by a dps.

172
00:14:44,442 --> 00:14:51,470
Scott: and I've always wondered the same thing like, hey, you know tanks that are being constantly healed, it's like number in any game has numbers, right?

173
00:14:52,210 --> 00:14:54,257
Scott: No, you know, numbers beat skills.

174
00:14:54,739 --> 00:14:58,410
Scott: It's like, yeah, you might be really skilled at doing headshots, right?

175
00:14:58,893 --> 00:15:06,064
Scott: But if my number is big enough that a headshot doesn't kill me, you, it doesn't, your skills are canceled out, right?

176
00:15:06,145 --> 00:15:12,607
Scott: It's like that, you know, that's why skill based games usually have less numbers in them, right?

177
00:15:12,627 --> 00:15:16,785
Scott: Then, you know, like an RPG, which has all numbers and isn't skill based at all.

178
00:15:16,805 --> 00:15:17,970
Scott: It's completely grinding based.

179
00:15:18,491 --> 00:15:21,462
Scott: So these games have numbers in them.

180
00:15:21,502 --> 00:15:25,075
Scott: Some characters have more HP, some have less, some do more damage, some do less.

