288
00:25:13,906 --> 00:25:35,118
Scott: Likewise, when you just think about conventions, a convention for tabletop gaming has a purpose of bringing... You need people to play tabletop games, so there is a desire... People who want to play tabletop games and don't have enough to play or don't have enough people to play or don't play often enough, a convention is a very useful event.

289
00:25:35,480 --> 00:25:37,930
