301
00:27:14,158 --> 00:27:17,769
Rym: PAX Unplugged is unique in the... And Magfest is special.

302
00:27:17,829 --> 00:27:19,033
Rym: Magfest is like this whole other thing.

303
00:27:19,294 --> 00:27:23,912
Rym: But of course, Magfest has a huge... Now, Magfest has a building dedicated to tabletop.

304
00:27:24,614 --> 00:27:26,600
