305
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:27,162
Rym: It is a building.

306
00:27:27,844 --> 00:27:39,874
Rym: But PAX Unplugged is basically the inverse of the Gen Con style of a tabletop con in that it runs via the philosophy of a Penny Arcade Expo.

307
00:27:40,315 --> 00:27:43,183
Rym: It just happens to focus exclusively on tabletop.

308
00:27:43,664 --> 00:27:48,119
Rym: So things like you don't need to buy individual tickets for all the events.

309
00:27:48,199 --> 00:27:49,685
Rym: Your badge covers everything.

310
00:27:50,127 --> 00:27:56,253
