311
00:27:57,215 --> 00:28:00,705
Rym: PAX Unplugged is more like an open, collaborative experience.

312
00:28:01,147 --> 00:28:06,388
Rym: And I personally think that is a better kind of experience, though there are merits of the other kind.

313
00:28:06,468 --> 00:28:07,794
Rym: I don't want to go too deep into that thing.

314
00:28:08,256 --> 00:28:26,837
Rym: But it is noteworthy that this one is so unlike the other ones, to the point that, while I was enforcing, the number of people who asked me what ticket they needed to get into the main theater to see Acquisitions Incorporated or Jonathan Colton at this con were as in the dozens.

315
00:28:27,820 --> 00:28:34,282
Rym: Dozens of people did not understand until I explained it to them that they could just get in line and see these things.

316
00:28:34,543 --> 00:28:36,572
Rym: They did not need to do anything special to get in.

317
00:28:36,933 --> 00:28:40,124
