320
00:28:50,904 --> 00:28:56,865
Scott: But they're tabletop con goers, and so they may be, you know, used to that.

321
00:28:57,086 --> 00:29:19,332
Rym: Now, the last reason I think we should talk about this PAX Unplugged is that the previous PAX Unplugged, which was, I would say, the first full-on PAX since the pandemic wound down, like the first one that was past that threshold and was full, that PAX Unplugged, the previous one, was overcrowded, was difficult to navigate.

322
00:29:19,512 --> 00:29:26,700
Rym: Like, it was bursting at the seams, and it made the experience actually not that great compared to previous Unplugs and other PAXs.

323
00:29:27,182 --> 00:29:36,229
Scott: Right, well, the people were there, but I think, you know, the industry and the con itself were not prepared to accommodate that, right?

324
00:29:36,309 --> 00:29:36,791
Scott: It was like, "Oh,

325
00:29:36,811 --> 00:29:37,052
Scott: shit!"

326
00:29:37,192 --> 00:29:37,373
Scott: Right?

327
00:29:37,433 --> 00:29:58,844
