328
00:29:59,406 --> 00:30:02,235
Scott: Actually being like, "Okay, this is gonna sell out.

329
00:30:02,616 --> 00:30:06,027
Scott: Let's make sure we can do sell-out-worthy

330
00:30:06,127 --> 00:30:06,529
